* text=auto
*.js text eol=lf
*.jsx text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.scss text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf

# Shell scripts run under bash on every platform (the React prebuild, the
# Linux/mac build scripts). `text=auto` above writes them with the native line
# ending on checkout, and bash refuses CRLF; measured 2026-09-15 on a fresh
# Windows clone: landing-page/scripts/setup-env.sh failed and no installer built.
*.sh text eol=lf
